WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:07.686
CompTIA Network Plus, domain 1, Networking concepts, which is 23 percent of the exam.

00:00:07.686 --> 00:00:10.295
This lesson covers objective 1 point 6.

00:00:10.295 --> 00:00:14.710
Compare and contrast network topologies, architectures, and types.

00:00:14.710 --> 00:00:19.460
Under provider links, there's one that depends on how far away you are.

00:00:21.800 --> 00:00:25.510
D S L delivers internet over ordinary telephone lines.

00:00:25.830 --> 00:00:31.320
The farther your home or office is from the provider's equipment, the weaker the signal, and the slower the connection.

00:00:31.670 --> 00:00:34.071
Distance goes up, speed goes down.

00:00:34.071 --> 00:00:36.260
That is the signature of D S L.

00:00:38.600 --> 00:00:45.027
If a question mentions telephone lines and speed that drops with distance from the provider, the answer is D S L.

00:00:45.027 --> 00:00:46.790
That's objective one point six.
